OL,3,AGPs, police and pharmacies among UK
OL,4,Aservices affected by Microsoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FGPs, police and pharmacies are among UK
OL,7,Fservices affected by a global outage on
OL,8,Fsome Microsoft platforms.
OL,10,FSome GP surgeries have urged patients
OL,11,Fnot to submit messages via their
OL,12,Fwebsite while the problem remains,
OL,13,Fwhile several large police forces are
OL,14,Furging members of the public to call if
OL,15,Fthey want to make a report. MPs are
OL,16,Falso affected.
OL,18,FMicrosoft has said the problem was
OL,19,Fcaused by a higher-than-usual stress on
OL,20,Fits servers and that the fixes it had
OL,21,Fput in place were "not taking as
OL,22,Fexpected".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
